#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: buildVars.py:21
msgid "TactileScreen"
msgstr "TactileScreen"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid "Mirrors the computer screen on a DotPad tactile graphical display. "
msgstr "Speglar skärmen på den grafiska ytan på en DotPad. "

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid ""
"Moved image processing to a worker thread and optimized the brightness "
"calculation when generating the monochrome image."
msgstr ""
"Flyttade bildbehandlingen till en arbetstråd och optimerade beräkningen "
"av ljusstyrka vid generering av monokrombilden."

